# Blood Moon ("Nonbasic lands are Mountains") on Darksteel Citadel, an artifact land with indestructible and "{T}: Add {C}".
# CR 305.7: setting a land's subtype takes every ability of its rules text - a keyword ability among them (CR 702.12) - and
# changes no card type, so in layer 4 Citadel becomes an Artifact Land - Mountain with no abilities but "{T}: Add {R}"
# (CR 305.6). Before the Moon, Bot2's Disenchant on Citadel destroys nothing (CR 702.12b: the positive control); under it,
# the second Disenchant destroys it. It taps for {R} and not {C} under the Moon; it is still an artifact, which is why
# Disenchant may target it at all.

